WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.150
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.420 --> 01:34.950
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.470 --> 01:37.830
[Episode 14]

4
01:39.150 --> 01:42.370
[Nanchang Headquarters, Jiangxi]

5
01:43.220 --> 01:45.900
[Chiang Kai-shek, Generalissimo of the Military Affairs of the Commission of Kuomintang]

6
01:45.250 --> 01:45.990
Try it.

7
01:46.050 --> 01:48.840
[He Guoguang, Director of the 1st Department, Nanchang Headquarters]

8
01:58.560 --> 02:00.070
How does it taste?

9
02:01.070 --> 02:01.930
It's fragrant.

10
02:03.950 --> 02:06.230
This tea has a very elegant name,

11
02:06.790 --> 02:08.750
called Sweet Dew of Mount Mengding.

12
02:08.750 --> 02:10.820
Liu Xiang brought it to me

13
02:10.840 --> 02:12.110
when he came to Nanjing last month.

14
02:12.110 --> 02:13.980
You know I don't drink tea.

15
02:14.930 --> 02:16.290
So, Yuanjing,

16
02:16.630 --> 02:18.829
I specially asked you to taste it for me.

17
02:20.390 --> 02:21.300
I see.

18
02:21.710 --> 02:22.750
Generalissimo,

19
02:23.120 --> 02:24.150
you asked me to come here

20
02:24.150 --> 02:27.079
not just to taste tea for you, right?

21
02:28.590 --> 02:30.630
You are a smart man, Yuanjing.

22
02:31.150 --> 02:33.390
I was thinking, you and Liu Xiang

23
02:33.420 --> 02:35.150
must know each other very well.

24
02:36.460 --> 02:37.390
Generalissimo,

25
02:37.590 --> 02:38.280
Liu Xiang and I

26
02:38.280 --> 02:41.540
were classmates at the Sichuan Army Short-course School.

27
02:42.670 --> 02:45.230
What kind of person do you think he is?

28
02:46.720 --> 02:48.840
He seems dull on the surface,

29
02:48.860 --> 02:50.370
but he is quite scheming.

30
02:51.430 --> 02:53.000
Well said.

31
02:53.430 --> 02:55.100
Not just scheming,

32
02:55.190 --> 02:56.680
he is extremely clever.

33
02:57.079 --> 02:58.190
As soon as we met,

34
02:58.190 --> 03:00.840
he asked me for money, guns, and power.

35
03:01.030 --> 03:02.710
But when I told him

36
03:02.710 --> 03:04.400
I would send 10 divisions of the army

37
03:04.400 --> 03:06.280
into Sichuan to help him suppress the Communists,

38
03:06.280 --> 03:08.080
he made all sorts of excuses.

39
03:08.430 --> 03:09.280
He told me

40
03:09.360 --> 03:12.960
he could act vigorously, quickly, and firmly.

41
03:13.270 --> 03:14.800
He used the slogan I proposed

42
03:14.800 --> 03:16.310
to shut my mouth.

43
03:17.030 --> 03:17.630
He is the kind of person

44
03:17.630 --> 03:19.450
who only wants benefits and won't give up territory.

45
03:19.450 --> 03:20.850
This fits his character.

46
03:20.910 --> 03:21.770
Generalissimo,

47
03:21.770 --> 03:22.740
I heard

48
03:23.310 --> 03:25.579
you agreed to all his demands.

49
03:25.750 --> 03:28.910
I really don't understand your intention.

50
03:28.960 --> 03:31.120
Yang Yongtai suggested 3 words to me:

51
03:31.210 --> 03:32.329
take it slow.

52
03:32.680 --> 03:35.079
So, I gave him what he wanted.

53
03:35.110 --> 03:36.829
He wouldn't let the Central Army enter Sichuan,

54
03:36.829 --> 03:38.160
and I agreed to that too.

55
03:38.560 --> 03:40.800
But I made a small request:

56
03:40.910 --> 03:43.310
to send the Generalissimo's Headquarters Staff Regiment

57
03:43.310 --> 03:45.079
into Sichuan to help him suppress the Communists.

58
03:45.079 --> 03:46.030
He agreed?

59
03:46.260 --> 03:47.390
If he hadn't agreed,

60
03:47.440 --> 03:50.230
I wouldn't be meeting you here today.

61
03:50.710 --> 03:52.870
Please enlighten me, Generalissimo.

62
03:53.030 --> 03:54.840
Yang Yongtai recommended you

63
03:54.990 --> 03:57.920
for the position of director of this Staff Regiment.

64
03:57.950 --> 03:58.820
Generalissimo,

65
03:58.820 --> 04:02.130
I'm afraid I'm not qualified for this.

66
04:02.560 --> 04:05.050
Yuanjing, no need to be so modest.

67
04:05.120 --> 04:06.000
Please sit.

68
04:07.150 --> 04:08.750
I read the document you wrote

69
04:09.120 --> 04:10.330
on the strategy to suppress the Communists

70
04:10.330 --> 04:11.310
in the Southwest.

71
04:11.310 --> 04:12.640
It's very well written.

72
04:13.060 --> 04:16.620
Among the 3 southwestern provinces of Sichuan, Yunnan, and Guizhou,

73
04:16.620 --> 04:18.730
Sichuan is the most important.

74
04:18.890 --> 04:22.010
After you arrive in Sichuan, you not only need to suppress the Communists,

75
04:22.010 --> 04:23.300
but also stabilize Sichuan.

76
04:23.300 --> 04:25.540
In the future, we will rely on Sichuan

77
04:26.000 --> 04:27.800
to manage the entire Southwest.

78
04:28.750 --> 04:29.870
So, Yuanjing,

79
04:30.080 --> 04:32.380
you have a heavy responsibility and a long way to go.

80
04:32.380 --> 04:34.090
Generalissimo, I understand.

81
04:34.090 --> 04:35.100
Please rest assured.

82
04:35.100 --> 04:37.610
I will strictly follow your orders

83
04:37.780 --> 04:38.580
and go all out.

84
04:39.130 --> 04:40.010
Good.

85
04:40.580 --> 04:42.500
Generalissimo, I have an idea.

86
04:43.460 --> 04:46.860
I'd like to treat you to some fresh Sweet Dew of Mount Mengding

87
04:46.960 --> 04:48.820
from next year's spring harvest.

88
04:51.120 --> 04:52.360
You know,

89
04:53.010 --> 04:54.720
I don't drink tea.

90
04:55.540 --> 04:57.770
But I hope next spring,

91
04:58.000 --> 05:01.880
I can personally go to Chongqing to present an award to you.

92
05:02.410 --> 05:03.940
Thank you, Generalissimo.

93
05:07.080 --> 05:09.160
[Zhu De, Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission (CRMC); Commander-in-Chief of the Red Army]

94
05:10.990 --> 05:13.070
Telegrams from various Corps have been arriving,

95
05:13.070 --> 05:14.980
supporting the Military Commission's resolution.

96
05:14.980 --> 05:16.980
Especially Comrades Peng Dehuai and Yang Shangkun.

97
05:16.910 --> 05:18.010
[Zhou Enlai, CPC Central Committee Politburo Standing Committee,]

98
05:17.120 --> 05:18.270
They not only declared

99
05:18.010 --> 05:19.110
[Vice-Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission, General Political Commissar of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

100
05:18.290 --> 05:20.600
their firm support for the new strategic policy,

101
05:20.600 --> 05:22.290
but also sent a special telegram to the Military Commission

102
05:22.290 --> 05:24.020
proposing specific actions.

103
05:24.270 --> 05:27.470
It seems advancing into northern Guizhou is what the army wants.

104
05:27.470 --> 05:29.160
Everyone has been holding back for too long,

105
05:29.160 --> 05:30.630
eager for a change.

106
05:31.650 --> 05:32.640
Vice Chairman Zhou.

107
05:32.640 --> 05:33.900
Commander-in-Chief.

108
05:34.000 --> 05:34.950
Bocheng.

109
05:35.310 --> 05:38.800
[Liu Bocheng, Chief of the General Staff of the Red Army and concurrently Commander of the Military Commission Column]

110
05:35.830 --> 05:37.070
Commander-in-Chief.

111
05:37.070 --> 05:39.390
Enlai and I were just talking about you.

112
05:41.600 --> 05:42.530
Vice Chairman Zhou.

113
05:42.530 --> 05:45.860
Comrade Bocheng, welcome back to the Military Commission.

114
05:47.440 --> 05:49.130
The Military Commission is too busy.

115
05:49.130 --> 05:51.240
We didn't even have time to throw you a welcome party.

116
05:51.240 --> 05:52.070
I propose

117
05:52.090 --> 05:53.390
we give a warm round of applause

118
05:53.390 --> 05:57.050
to welcome Comrade Liu Bocheng back as Chief of the General Staff.

119
06:01.620 --> 06:02.860
Thank you, comrades.

120
06:03.070 --> 06:04.680
Bocheng, you've had a hard journey.

121
06:04.680 --> 06:05.560
Come warm up by the fire.

122
06:05.560 --> 06:06.950
Come.

123
06:06.970 --> 06:08.500
Everyone, get back to work.

124
06:09.140 --> 06:09.620
Okay.

125
06:11.120 --> 06:11.870
Come, sit.

126
06:11.870 --> 06:13.730
Commander-in-Chief, I'll do it.

127
06:14.380 --> 06:15.330
Come, sit.

128
06:16.820 --> 06:17.690
Bocheng.

129
06:18.630 --> 06:19.670
How are you feeling?

130
06:19.670 --> 06:20.470
Very excited.

131
06:20.970 --> 06:22.880
Also a bit surprised.

132
06:23.870 --> 06:24.830
Besides...

133
06:25.270 --> 06:26.190
Bocheng,

134
06:26.480 --> 06:28.740
you still have some concerns, don't you?

135
06:30.310 --> 06:33.680
Commander-in-Chief, you know me best.

136
06:33.850 --> 06:34.770
Let me tell you,

137
06:34.950 --> 06:36.830
your transfer back to the Military Commission this time

138
06:36.830 --> 06:39.600
was passed by a vote at the Politburo meeting.

139
06:39.870 --> 06:41.210
Your position as Chief of the General Staff

140
06:41.210 --> 06:43.060
and Commander of the Military Commission Column

141
06:43.060 --> 06:46.409
is perfectly justifiable and well-deserved.

142
06:47.460 --> 06:50.370
I would like to thank the comrades for their trust in me.

143
06:50.370 --> 06:51.370
Comrade Bocheng.

144
06:51.680 --> 06:52.800
Do you want to know

145
06:52.950 --> 06:55.950
who proposed your return to the Military Commission?

146
06:58.030 --> 06:59.260
Wasn't it you two?

147
07:01.180 --> 07:03.520
Commander-in-Chief Zhu and I wouldn't dare take the credit.

148
07:03.520 --> 07:04.980
At the Politburo meeting,

149
07:05.480 --> 07:07.550
the one who strongly advocated for your return

150
07:07.550 --> 07:08.780
was Comrade Zedong.

151
07:11.210 --> 07:12.260
Chairman Mao?

152
07:18.700 --> 07:21.530
Chairman Mao's magnanimity

153
07:22.160 --> 07:23.490
makes me feel ashamed.

154
07:23.910 --> 07:26.140
Bocheng, what do you mean?

155
07:26.590 --> 07:27.850
Commander-in-Chief,

156
07:28.120 --> 07:29.250
have you forgotten?

157
07:29.860 --> 07:31.540
During the Ningdu Meeting,

158
07:31.870 --> 07:33.220
when Chairman Mao was dismissed

159
07:33.220 --> 07:36.390
from his post as General Political Commissar of the 1st Front Red Army,

160
07:36.390 --> 07:37.750
I agreed with it.

161
07:37.870 --> 07:39.190
I voted in favor.

162
07:39.810 --> 07:41.340
And it was at that meeting

163
07:41.610 --> 07:44.940
that I was elected Chief of the General Staff of the Red Army.

164
07:45.560 --> 07:47.630
Times have changed.

165
07:47.830 --> 07:48.780
At that time,

166
07:48.800 --> 07:50.500
you had just returned from the Soviet Union

167
07:50.500 --> 07:52.760
and didn't know much about the situation

168
07:52.810 --> 07:54.360
of the Red Army and the Soviet area.

169
07:54.360 --> 07:55.900
According to the Soviet military theory

170
07:55.900 --> 07:57.090
centered on capturing

171
07:57.090 --> 07:58.890
central cities,

172
07:59.190 --> 08:00.430
it's not surprising that you opposed Mao's

173
08:00.430 --> 08:04.080
guerrilla and mobile warfare tactics.

174
08:05.660 --> 08:07.460
Since the 5th Counter-Encirclement Campaign,

175
08:07.460 --> 08:10.140
I have been reviewing and examining myself.

176
08:10.640 --> 08:15.450
Especially during the Battle of Guangchang and the bloody battle at the Xiang River,

177
08:15.950 --> 08:18.410
seeing so many comrades fall with my own eyes

178
08:18.440 --> 08:19.950
made me realize even more

179
08:20.700 --> 08:22.310
how much harm

180
08:22.570 --> 08:24.500
wrong military command can cause.

181
08:24.950 --> 08:26.190
The more I think about it,

182
08:26.190 --> 08:29.270
the more I feel that Chairman Mao's tactics

183
08:29.640 --> 08:31.050
were practical

184
08:32.120 --> 08:33.429
and correct.

185
08:35.280 --> 08:36.280
Comrade Bocheng,

186
08:36.490 --> 08:38.159
appointing people for the public good

187
08:38.159 --> 08:39.669
is perhaps exactly why Comrade Zedong

188
08:39.669 --> 08:43.270
strongly advocated for your return to the Military Commission.

189
08:52.030 --> 08:55.000
On December 20, 1934,

190
08:55.670 --> 08:58.840
the Central Red Army changed its passive situation,

191
08:59.120 --> 09:02.360
advanced through the hinterland of Guizhou towards northern Guizhou,

192
09:02.360 --> 09:03.860
and successively captured county towns

193
09:03.860 --> 09:06.940
such as Jianhe, Taigong, Zhenyuan, and Shibing.

194
09:08.270 --> 09:09.270
On the 29th,

195
09:09.560 --> 09:11.440
they captured Weng'an County

196
09:11.950 --> 09:14.360
and approached the south bank of the Wu River.

197
09:14.360 --> 09:16.670
The KMT troops sighed in frustration,

198
09:16.690 --> 09:20.220
feeling as if the Red Army had entered an undefended territory.

199
09:23.200 --> 09:27.060
[Zhenyuan, Guizhou]

200
09:31.050 --> 09:31.980
Report.

201
09:32.150 --> 09:34.950
Urgent telegram from the Nanchang Headquarters.

202
09:40.940 --> 09:44.390
It seems your 1st Column will have to work hard for a few more days.

203
09:44.390 --> 09:46.990
We'll make adjustments when we reach Guiyang.

204
09:47.510 --> 09:49.770
The Zhu-Mao Communist army is heading towards the Wu River.

205
09:49.770 --> 09:52.770
[Wu Qiwei, Commander of the 1st Route Army, 2nd Army Group of the KMT Troops' Pursuit Army]

206
09:49.980 --> 09:51.580
Why aren't we pursuing them?

207
09:51.600 --> 09:53.240
Why are we going to Guiyang instead?

208
09:53.240 --> 09:55.580
They just suffered a disastrous defeat at the Xiang River

209
09:55.580 --> 09:57.750
and are unlikely to force a crossing of the Wu River.

210
09:57.750 --> 10:00.260
But what if they're using a feint to mislead us,

211
10:00.260 --> 10:01.320
coveting Guiyang?

212
10:01.380 --> 10:02.800
[Xue Yue, Frontline Commander of the KMT Troops' Pursuit Army and Commander of the 1st Army Group]

213
10:01.460 --> 10:03.110
Then we'll be in big trouble.

214
10:03.910 --> 10:05.710
But Guiyang is a strategic town.

215
10:06.550 --> 10:08.910
Since Zhu and Mao's forces have been badly beaten,

216
10:08.910 --> 10:09.910
I don't think they'll

217
10:09.910 --> 10:11.270
go looking for trouble.

218
10:11.870 --> 10:15.730
I think pursuing the Communist army should still be our top priority.

219
10:15.750 --> 10:16.480
You...

220
10:16.750 --> 10:18.960
Your mind is only on pursuit and suppression.

221
10:18.960 --> 10:20.620
But do you know what our Generalissimo

222
10:20.620 --> 10:21.680
is thinking about?

223
10:22.240 --> 10:24.500
He's not just thinking about Guiyang or Guizhou.

224
10:24.500 --> 10:26.900
He's thinking about the entire Southwest.

225
10:27.010 --> 10:29.970
Look, whether the Communist army is fleeing west

226
10:30.750 --> 10:31.770
or advancing on Guiyang,

227
10:31.770 --> 10:33.170
we don't know right now.

228
10:33.890 --> 10:35.750
But Liao Lei's troops of the Guangxi clique

229
10:35.750 --> 10:39.030
have already reached Duyun and Dushan,

230
10:39.170 --> 10:40.600
which are very close to Guiyang.

231
10:40.600 --> 10:42.480
If Wang Jialie's territory

232
10:42.480 --> 10:44.390
is swallowed up by them,

233
10:44.570 --> 10:46.250
then the two of us will have a hard time explaining it

234
10:46.250 --> 10:47.720
to the Generalissimo.

235
10:48.150 --> 10:50.840
So, we must seize Guiyang first,

236
10:51.220 --> 10:53.480
and then turn back to suppress the Communists.

237
10:53.480 --> 10:57.000
You've finally figured it out.

238
10:58.870 --> 11:00.390
Personally speaking,

239
11:00.980 --> 11:02.670
you and I are both from the same hometown,

240
11:02.670 --> 11:03.960
both from Guangdong.

241
11:04.320 --> 11:05.630
After wandering for half our lives,

242
11:05.630 --> 11:06.760
we still need to find

243
11:06.840 --> 11:08.670
a very safe place for ourselves.

244
11:08.860 --> 11:11.250
Guizhou is a place where you can enter Sichuan to the north,

245
11:11.250 --> 11:13.510
Yunnan to the west, and Guangxi to the south.

246
11:13.510 --> 11:15.440
It is truly a chosen land.

247
11:15.850 --> 11:17.780
We must not miss this opportunity.

248
11:20.750 --> 11:24.670
Sir, I understand.

249
11:25.390 --> 11:26.850
As long as you understand.

250
11:28.320 --> 11:30.840
Order the troops to speed up.

251
11:31.510 --> 11:32.320
Yes, sir.

252
11:32.920 --> 11:39.200
[Huangping, Guizhou]

253
11:34.510 --> 11:36.390
Comrades, carry it steadily.

254
11:36.800 --> 11:39.330
Let Vice Chairman Zhou sleep a little longer.

255
11:40.720 --> 11:41.690
Steady.

256
11:43.240 --> 11:44.340
Come on, let me do it.

257
11:44.340 --> 11:45.890
I have more experience than you.

258
11:45.890 --> 11:47.220
Come on, lift the board.

259
11:50.000 --> 11:50.970
Let's go.

260
11:54.530 --> 11:55.500
Zhou.

261
11:56.360 --> 11:57.360
Zhou Enlai.

262
11:57.380 --> 11:58.500
Tell me if you have anything to say.

263
11:58.500 --> 11:59.700
Enlai is resting.

264
11:59.810 --> 12:01.330
Zhou, Zhou Enlai.

265
12:03.600 --> 12:04.500
Enlai.

266
12:06.100 --> 12:08.260
Come on, let me get up.

267
12:08.290 --> 12:09.170
Enlai.

268
12:11.160 --> 12:12.040
Zhou Enlai.

269
12:12.510 --> 12:14.100
Why are we marching in the mountains?

270
12:14.100 --> 12:15.850
Why are we marching in the mountains?

271
12:15.850 --> 12:17.910
[Li De, Comintern Military Advisor]

272
12:16.230 --> 12:17.910
Why don't we execute the original plan?

273
12:17.910 --> 12:19.430
[Bo Gu (Qin Bangxian), Head of the CPC Central Committee]

274
12:18.120 --> 12:19.730
Why don't we execute the original plan?

275
12:19.730 --> 12:22.960
This is running away. We're just roaming from place to place.

276
12:22.960 --> 12:24.240
It's meaningless.

277
12:24.260 --> 12:25.600
This is running away. We're just roaming from place to place.

278
12:24.920 --> 12:25.990
[Wu Xiuquan, Translator]

279
12:25.600 --> 12:26.570
It's meaningless.

280
12:26.570 --> 12:27.620
Comrade Li De.

281
12:28.670 --> 12:30.440
Regarding the resolution of the Politburo of the Central Committee

282
12:30.440 --> 12:31.720
and the new strategic deployment,

283
12:31.720 --> 12:32.670
when we were in Liping,

284
12:32.670 --> 12:33.390
wasn't it already officially

285
12:33.390 --> 12:34.670
conveyed to you?

286
12:35.500 --> 12:39.650
Didn't you say we should proceed from reality?

287
12:39.930 --> 12:41.410
Didn't you say we should proceed from reality?

288
12:41.410 --> 12:43.100
But the situation has changed now.

289
12:43.100 --> 12:45.130
He Long and Ren Bishi

290
12:45.500 --> 12:48.910
have already established a new base area in northwestern Hunan.

291
12:48.910 --> 12:51.510
They have pinned down a large number of troops in Changde.

292
12:51.510 --> 12:52.200
He Long and Ren Bishi

293
12:52.200 --> 12:53.890
have already established a new base area in northwestern Hunan.

294
12:53.890 --> 12:55.830
They have pinned down a large number of troops in Changde.

295
12:55.830 --> 12:58.360
We can completely return to eastern Guizhou,

296
12:58.510 --> 13:02.600
continue north and join forces with the 2nd and 6th Corps.

297
13:02.600 --> 13:04.330
...continue north and join forces with the 2nd and 6th Corps.

298
13:04.330 --> 13:05.330
Comrade Li De.

299
13:06.960 --> 13:08.840
I remind you,

300
13:09.170 --> 13:10.030
the 2nd and 6th Corps' action

301
13:10.030 --> 13:12.030
of pinning down the enemy in Changde

302
13:12.320 --> 13:15.950
is to cover the Central Red Army's advance into northern Guizhou.

303
13:15.950 --> 13:18.840
And the 5th line of defense set up by the enemy in northeastern Guizhou

304
13:18.840 --> 13:21.920
and northwestern Hunan has not disappeared.

305
13:22.970 --> 13:24.500
But what about the Wu River?

306
13:24.600 --> 13:25.770
But what about the Wu River?

307
13:25.770 --> 13:26.940
Do you think with our strength,

308
13:26.940 --> 13:28.180
we can cross the Wu River?

309
13:28.180 --> 13:29.390
Do you think with our strength,

310
13:29.390 --> 13:30.290
we can cross the Wu River?

311
13:30.290 --> 13:31.530
Comrade Li De.

312
13:31.920 --> 13:33.120
What reason do you have

313
13:33.120 --> 13:36.120
to question the combat effectiveness of the Red Army?

314
13:36.440 --> 13:37.700
Commander-in-Chief,

315
13:37.790 --> 13:39.100
Comrade Li De's concerns

316
13:39.100 --> 13:41.030
are not completely unreasonable.

317
13:42.350 --> 13:44.630
I think instead of risking crossing the river,

318
13:44.630 --> 13:46.870
it's better to establish a temporary base

319
13:46.870 --> 13:48.670
on the south bank of the Wu River.

320
13:48.960 --> 13:50.320
After a short rest,

321
13:50.500 --> 13:51.810
we turn east

322
13:52.020 --> 13:53.370
and return to western Hunan

323
13:53.370 --> 13:54.970
to join the 2nd and 6th Corps.

324
13:55.020 --> 13:55.970
Comrade Bo Gu,

325
13:56.480 --> 13:58.670
is this the idea you and Comrade Li De

326
13:58.690 --> 14:00.420
came up with after discussion?

327
14:06.400 --> 14:07.330
Yes.

328
14:07.410 --> 14:09.990
After all, I am still the person in overall charge of the Party.

329
14:09.990 --> 14:11.190
Comrade Li De and I

330
14:11.530 --> 14:13.640
are still members of the supreme Troika.

331
14:13.640 --> 14:16.040
Do you also think the Troika can override

332
14:16.060 --> 14:17.510
the Politburo of the Central Committee

333
14:17.510 --> 14:19.870
and overturn its resolutions?

334
14:27.120 --> 14:28.080
Comrade Enlai,

335
14:28.630 --> 14:29.670
then I propose

336
14:29.870 --> 14:32.410
that the Politburo of the Central Committee reconvene

337
14:32.410 --> 14:35.670
to review the resolution of the Liping Politburo Meeting.

338
14:36.780 --> 14:38.310
That should be fine, right?

339
14:39.170 --> 14:40.330
I second that.

340
14:44.870 --> 14:45.510
Okay.

341
14:46.000 --> 14:47.920
I will seek the opinions of other members

342
14:47.920 --> 14:50.120
and convene a new meeting of the Politburo as soon as possible

343
14:50.120 --> 14:51.600
to discuss your proposal.

344
15:08.480 --> 15:09.810
Nonsense.

345
15:10.510 --> 15:11.970
If we let him continue like this,

346
15:11.970 --> 15:14.550
the new line of the Central Committee will be messed up.

347
15:14.550 --> 15:15.540
Commander-in-Chief.

348
15:15.540 --> 15:17.810
Let's communicate with other members as soon as possible.

349
15:17.810 --> 15:18.400
Okay.

350
15:18.780 --> 15:20.530
Mao, Luofu, and Jiaxiang are behind.

351
15:20.530 --> 15:21.320
I'll go talk to them.

352
15:21.320 --> 15:22.530
You go to the other comrades.

353
15:22.530 --> 15:23.300
Okay.

354
16:12.270 --> 16:12.890
Secretary Huang.

355
16:12.890 --> 16:13.370
Here.

356
16:16.270 --> 16:17.870
I think this place is not bad.

357
16:17.890 --> 16:18.760
Paint a slogan:

358
16:18.780 --> 16:20.240
90 kilometers to Guiyang.

359
16:20.350 --> 16:21.080
Yes.

360
16:23.130 --> 16:24.920
Regiment Commander, Political Commissar.

361
16:24.920 --> 16:26.640
Regiment Commander, Political Commissar.

362
16:26.640 --> 16:27.760
Are we really going to attack Guiyang?

363
16:27.760 --> 16:30.150
Didn't the previous order say to cross the Wu River?

364
16:30.150 --> 16:34.500
[Geng Biao, Commander of the 4th Regiment, 2nd Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

365
16:30.590 --> 16:31.850
Tell me what you think.

366
16:32.270 --> 16:33.640
Is it better to cross the Wu River

367
16:33.640 --> 16:34.760
or attack Guiyang?

368
16:35.270 --> 16:36.910
As long as you let our company lead the main attack,

369
16:36.910 --> 16:38.670
I'd even dare to attack Nanjing right now.

370
16:38.610 --> 16:41.100
[Yang Chengwu, Political Commissar of the 4th Regiment, 2nd Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

371
16:39.610 --> 16:41.470
Alright, then wait for the order.

372
16:41.540 --> 16:42.380
Yes, sir.

373
16:44.600 --> 16:45.750
Take a look.

374
16:45.430 --> 16:47.260
[Wan Shufen, Wang Jialie's Wife]

375
16:46.330 --> 16:48.420
This is a telegram from Huang Liehou.

376
16:48.300 --> 16:51.070
[Wang Jialie, Commander of the Kuomintang's 25th Army and Chairman of Guizhou Provincial Government]

377
16:48.840 --> 16:50.390
It says the Central Army

378
16:50.390 --> 16:52.720
had already publicly posted a notice in Zhenyuan.

379
16:52.720 --> 16:54.080
The notice says,

380
16:54.270 --> 16:56.800
regardless of the Communist army's direction,

381
16:56.800 --> 16:59.370
the sole purpose of this army

382
17:00.690 --> 17:02.210
is to enter Guiyang.

383
17:08.859 --> 17:10.170
I actually think

384
17:10.410 --> 17:15.020
Generalissimo Chiang ordering Xue Yue to secure Guiyang first

385
17:15.050 --> 17:16.910
isn't completely unreasonable.

386
17:17.050 --> 17:18.720
After all, in front of the Communist army,

387
17:18.720 --> 17:20.460
there is still the natural barrier of the Wu River.

388
17:20.460 --> 17:22.869
They won't be able to cross it anytime soon.

389
17:23.319 --> 17:23.950
Map!

390
17:23.970 --> 17:24.630
Yes, ma'am.

391
17:27.200 --> 17:27.720
Go.

392
17:34.480 --> 17:35.530
Darling.

393
17:35.690 --> 17:38.100
You think too highly of Chiang.

394
17:38.920 --> 17:39.920
For so many years,

395
17:40.110 --> 17:42.640
when has he ever considered the local areas?

396
17:43.270 --> 17:47.190
His mind is full of schemes to play one enemy against another.

397
17:47.340 --> 17:48.580
I don't think so.

398
17:49.550 --> 17:50.770
Last time I went to Nanjing,

399
17:50.770 --> 17:52.440
he kept telling me

400
17:52.950 --> 17:55.010
that Guizhou is different from Guangdong and Guangxi,

401
17:55.010 --> 17:56.900
and that he trusts us very much.

402
17:57.160 --> 17:59.570
Mrs. Chiang was extremely close to me.

403
17:59.960 --> 18:01.110
When we left, didn't they even give us

404
18:01.110 --> 18:02.110
10,000 silver dollars

405
18:02.110 --> 18:03.790
and 200 German-made Mauser pistols?

406
18:03.790 --> 18:05.750
Just for that little benefit,

407
18:06.200 --> 18:07.660
you're already grateful?

408
18:08.220 --> 18:09.260
When fishing,

409
18:09.280 --> 18:11.520
you have to put bait on the hook, right?

410
18:12.240 --> 18:13.560
10,000 silver dollars

411
18:14.080 --> 18:15.390
and 200 guns

412
18:15.410 --> 18:17.780
are just bait at best.

413
18:18.260 --> 18:19.790
What does Chiang want to do?

414
18:21.030 --> 18:22.750
What Chiang wants to catch

415
18:22.750 --> 18:24.550
is our entire Guizhou.

416
18:24.910 --> 18:25.660
Besides,

417
18:25.730 --> 18:27.140
compared to the opium tax,

418
18:27.140 --> 18:28.670
that 10,000 silver dollars

419
18:28.810 --> 18:30.120
is nothing.

420
18:31.910 --> 18:35.150
When the Communist army first arrived in Guizhou,

421
18:35.660 --> 18:37.630
I wanted to muddy the waters.

422
18:37.720 --> 18:40.170
I sent telegrams everywhere for help.

423
18:40.400 --> 18:43.200
I just wanted the various forces to come to Guizhou

424
18:43.230 --> 18:45.430
and check and balance each other.

425
18:45.800 --> 18:46.870
But what happened?

426
18:47.160 --> 18:49.360
The Hunan Army turned back halfway.

427
18:49.520 --> 18:50.410
The Sichuan Army?

428
18:50.410 --> 18:52.740
They only guard their own river defenses.

429
18:53.680 --> 18:55.140
The Guangxi Army did come,

430
18:55.150 --> 18:57.300
but they stopped at Dushan and wouldn't go further,

431
18:57.300 --> 18:58.830
waiting to reap the spoils.

432
18:59.530 --> 19:02.000
In the end, we had no choice

433
19:02.100 --> 19:03.900
but to bring in the Central Army.

434
19:04.110 --> 19:05.640
But who would have thought,

435
19:06.010 --> 19:08.660
the Central Army didn't fight the Communist army either.

436
19:08.660 --> 19:10.590
They headed straight for Guiyang.

437
19:10.620 --> 19:12.900
Then what do you say we should do?

438
19:13.010 --> 19:14.250
What else can we do?

439
19:14.550 --> 19:15.940
Take it one step at a time.

440
19:15.940 --> 19:18.000
It's because our Guizhou Army is weak

441
19:18.930 --> 19:20.790
and unable to protect our wealth.

442
19:24.060 --> 19:25.300
Red Army,

443
19:26.090 --> 19:27.400
Central Army,

444
19:28.050 --> 19:31.160
are you passing gods

445
19:31.680 --> 19:33.770
or life-claiming demons?

446
19:33.920 --> 19:35.850
Only the Bodhisattva knows.

447
19:41.630 --> 19:42.760
Where are you going?

448
19:43.310 --> 19:45.110
Hongfu Temple, to burn incense.

449
19:45.270 --> 19:46.800
Burning incense this late?

450
19:47.950 --> 19:49.150
I'll smash it open.

451
19:56.110 --> 19:58.630
Here, eat more.

452
20:13.430 --> 20:20.920
[Site of the Houchang Conference, Weng'an, Guizhou]

453
20:13.640 --> 20:14.430
Comrades.

454
20:14.570 --> 20:18.160
This is the decision I drafted based on everyone's opinions,

455
20:18.190 --> 20:21.040
regarding the new course of action

456
20:21.060 --> 20:23.170
after the field army crosses the Wu River.

457
20:21.180 --> 20:22.930
[Chen Yun, Member of the Standing Committee of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee]

458
20:23.590 --> 20:24.890
It's for everyone to discuss.

459
20:24.890 --> 20:26.240
Can we cross it?

460
20:26.770 --> 20:27.830
Please take a look.

461
20:32.150 --> 20:36.180
[Mao Zedong, Chairman of the Central Executive Committee of the Chinese Soviet Republic]

462
20:37.910 --> 20:41.150
Who among you can guarantee that the Wu River before us

463
20:41.240 --> 20:42.000
won't be a second Xiang River?

464
20:42.000 --> 20:43.020
Who can guarantee that the Wu River before us

465
20:43.020 --> 20:44.450
won't be a second Xiang River?

466
20:44.450 --> 20:45.510
I can guarantee it.

467
20:45.790 --> 20:46.400
I can.

468
20:46.810 --> 20:47.530
Mao.

469
20:49.390 --> 20:50.900
How can you guarantee that?

470
20:50.900 --> 20:52.130
How can you guarantee that?

471
20:52.130 --> 20:54.960
I can guarantee it based on 3 points.

472
20:55.230 --> 20:57.170
First, at the Xiang River,

473
20:56.810 --> 20:57.620
[Luofu (Zhang Wentian), Member of the Politburo Standing Committee of the CPC Central Committee;]

474
20:57.310 --> 21:00.310
we ignored the changed enemy situation

475
20:57.620 --> 20:58.430
[Chairman of the Central Executive Committee of the Chinese Soviet Republic]

476
21:00.460 --> 21:01.910
and actively led tens of thousands of Red Army soldiers

477
21:01.910 --> 21:04.360
into the enemy's pocket.

478
21:05.770 --> 21:06.830
But at the Wu River,

479
21:06.830 --> 21:10.620
we made a comprehensive analysis based on the enemy situation.

480
21:11.110 --> 21:13.680
In response to the heavy enemy deployment

481
21:13.770 --> 21:15.450
in northeast Guizhou and northwest Hunan,

482
21:15.450 --> 21:17.810
and the weak enemy presence in northern Guizhou,

483
21:17.810 --> 21:19.210
based on this situation,

484
21:19.590 --> 21:22.390
we adopted a strategy of avoiding the strong and attacking the weak,

485
21:22.390 --> 21:24.630
actively avoiding the enemy's trap.

486
21:22.800 --> 21:23.780
[Wang Jiaxiang, Vice-Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission;]

487
21:23.780 --> 21:24.760
[Director of the General Political Department of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

488
21:24.870 --> 21:25.620
Second.

489
21:26.600 --> 21:28.350
Our troops set out from Jiangxi,

490
21:28.350 --> 21:30.910
marched west, and traveled too far.

491
21:31.000 --> 21:32.800
We've been through many battles

492
21:33.090 --> 21:34.350
and are too exhausted.

493
21:34.680 --> 21:37.850
We can take advantage of the enemy's brief weakness

494
21:36.930 --> 21:37.570
[Deng Fa, Alternate Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee]

495
21:37.570 --> 21:38.210
[and Director of the State Political Security Bureau]

496
21:38.110 --> 21:41.300
to give our troops a rest and a breather.

497
21:38.230 --> 21:39.180
[Liu Shaoqi, Alternate Member of the CPC Politburo and CPC Representative to the 8th Red Army Corps]

498
21:43.120 --> 21:45.190
Besides, once we reach northern Guizhou,

499
21:45.190 --> 21:48.360
we will have more strategic initiative.

500
21:48.380 --> 21:49.180
If we advance,

501
21:50.290 --> 21:51.840
we can cross the Yangtze River to the north,

502
21:51.840 --> 21:55.140
join forces with the the 4th Front Army, and fight the Japanese in the north.

503
21:55.140 --> 21:55.940
If we retreat,

504
21:56.070 --> 21:58.600
we can rely on the terrain of northern Guizhou

505
21:58.850 --> 22:00.500
to deal with the enemy.

506
22:01.160 --> 22:02.110
Mao,

507
22:02.590 --> 22:04.130
you are avoiding the main issue.

508
22:04.130 --> 22:05.360
You are avoiding the main issue.

509
22:05.360 --> 22:07.560
What I care about is how you can guarantee

510
22:07.560 --> 22:08.960
that the Red Army can cross the Wu River,

511
22:08.960 --> 22:10.880
which is a hundred times more treacherous than the Xiang River.

512
22:10.880 --> 22:13.200
What I care about is how you can guarantee

513
22:13.200 --> 22:14.480
that the Red Army can cross the Wu River,

514
22:14.480 --> 22:17.200
which is a hundred times more treacherous than the Xiang River.

515
22:17.200 --> 22:18.000
Tell him.

516
22:18.650 --> 22:21.820
I just said I can guarantee it based on 3 points.

517
22:21.890 --> 22:23.290
I've only mentioned two.

518
22:23.500 --> 22:25.230
Please ask him to let me finish.

519
22:25.720 --> 22:26.650
The third point.

520
22:27.900 --> 22:30.490
Although the natural conditions for crossing the Wu River are harsh,

521
22:30.490 --> 22:32.200
the enemy's defense is not strong.

522
22:32.200 --> 22:33.660
The combat effectiveness of the Guizhou Army

523
22:33.660 --> 22:37.060
is not on the same level as the Guangxi Army and the Hunan Army.

524
22:37.150 --> 22:37.950
Besides,

525
22:38.510 --> 22:39.900
after the Liping Meeting,

526
22:39.900 --> 22:42.360
we have profoundly conveyed the Politburo's resolution

527
22:42.360 --> 22:44.090
to every commander and fighter

528
22:44.250 --> 22:46.210
of the Red Army.

529
22:46.450 --> 22:48.870
Everyone is clear about the Central Committee's intentions.

530
22:48.870 --> 22:52.590
Everyone knows the Central Committee's next plan.

531
22:53.070 --> 22:54.130
Crossing the river

532
22:55.200 --> 22:56.460
is what the army wants.

533
23:02.640 --> 23:03.510
Comrade Li De.

534
23:03.860 --> 23:05.010
In my memory,

535
23:05.180 --> 23:07.460
as long as the Red Army is united,

536
23:07.830 --> 23:09.720
we have always been invincible.

537
23:09.850 --> 23:10.920
At the Xiang River,

538
23:11.090 --> 23:14.100
we could fight to the death to survive and break out of the encirclement.

539
23:14.100 --> 23:15.170
At the Wu River,

540
23:15.440 --> 23:17.220
every Red Army commander and fighter

541
23:17.220 --> 23:19.260
will also forge ahead

542
23:19.500 --> 23:20.830
to find a way to survive.

543
23:32.970 --> 23:34.500
I have another suggestion.

544
23:34.680 --> 23:37.260
From now on, regarding our strategic guidelines,

545
23:37.260 --> 23:40.980
the Military Commission must report to the Politburo meeting

546
23:41.060 --> 23:43.390
for collective discussion and decision.

547
23:43.570 --> 23:44.610
Comrade Luofu,

548
23:44.980 --> 23:45.910
are you trying to

549
23:46.060 --> 23:48.560
fundamentally abolish the military decision-making power

550
23:48.560 --> 23:50.000
of our Troika?

551
23:50.650 --> 23:51.600
Comrade Bo Gu,

552
23:51.860 --> 23:54.920
the formulation and implementation of any military line

553
23:54.920 --> 23:57.420
are for the development of the Chinese revolution.

554
23:57.420 --> 23:58.470
Today,

555
23:58.880 --> 24:00.640
it is to find a way for the Red Army to survive.

556
24:00.640 --> 24:02.770
Isn't it better to reach a consensus

557
24:03.210 --> 24:04.690
through discussion?

558
24:07.270 --> 24:08.320
When it's dawn,

559
24:08.540 --> 24:09.710
if the snow hasn't melted,

560
24:09.710 --> 24:11.710
I'll take some photos for everyone.

561
24:11.720 --> 24:13.800
Are you willing to use your precious dry plates?

562
24:13.800 --> 24:16.860
Isn't this the first time many comrades have seen snow?

563
24:16.970 --> 24:19.430
So I'd like to take a few group photos of them.

564
24:22.990 --> 24:24.680
Do you think we'll spend the New Year tomorrow

565
24:24.680 --> 24:27.010
on this side of the river or the other side?

566
24:28.900 --> 24:29.820
Hard to say.

567
24:29.850 --> 24:31.050
Regiment Commander.

568
24:31.230 --> 24:32.560
I bought the cured meat.

569
24:33.110 --> 24:35.640
This piece of meat is not bad. Quite fat.

570
24:35.660 --> 24:37.530
Fat, right? I picked it myself.

571
24:37.760 --> 24:39.130
Are the other dishes ready?

572
24:39.130 --> 24:40.550
The dried bamboo shoots have been soaked for a long time.

573
24:40.550 --> 24:42.950
Star anise, longan, and angelica are all bought.

574
24:42.950 --> 24:44.220
We're just missing your secret recipe.

575
24:44.220 --> 24:45.810
Okay, I'll cook for everyone.

576
24:45.810 --> 24:46.560
Report.

577
24:47.250 --> 24:48.230
Regiment Commander Geng, Political Commissar Yang,

578
24:48.230 --> 24:50.860
the division commander wants you at division headquarters immediately, awaiting orders.

579
24:50.860 --> 24:51.620
Let's go.

580
24:55.120 --> 24:57.730
On January 1, 1935,

581
24:58.330 --> 24:59.660
the CPC Central Committee Politburo meeting

582
24:59.660 --> 25:01.590
held in Houchang

583
25:01.900 --> 25:04.130
rejected Li De's erroneous opinion of not crossing the Wu River

584
25:04.130 --> 25:06.330
and returning to western Hunan.

585
25:07.000 --> 25:09.050
It decided to cross the Wu River

586
25:09.080 --> 25:12.360
and establish a new Soviet base area on the Sichuan-Guizhou border,

587
25:12.360 --> 25:15.910
primarily in the northern Guizhou area centered around Zunyi.

588
25:16.670 --> 25:18.070
The meeting also decided

589
25:18.320 --> 25:20.030
that regarding operational guidelines

590
25:20.030 --> 25:22.690
and the choice of time and place for operations,

591
25:23.090 --> 25:26.620
the Military Commission must report to the Politburo meeting.

592
25:27.430 --> 25:30.030
This actually abolished Li De's previous

593
25:30.050 --> 25:32.640
arbitrary military command power.

594
25:57.630 --> 25:58.720
This is Liu Yalou.

595
25:57.790 --> 26:00.770
[Liu Yalou, Political Commissar of the 2nd Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

596
26:00.280 --> 26:00.880
Yes.

597
26:01.800 --> 26:02.530
Understood.

598
26:04.600 --> 26:05.280
Geng Biao.

599
26:05.710 --> 26:06.320
Chengwu.

600
26:06.520 --> 26:08.080
The Military Commission has officially issued

601
26:08.080 --> 26:09.670
the combat mission to cross the Wu River to the north.

602
26:09.670 --> 26:12.190
The higher command has ordered your regiment to lead the crossing as the vanguard,

603
26:12.190 --> 26:14.260
crossing the Wu River first at the Jiangjiehe Crossing

604
26:14.260 --> 26:15.710
and securing the river defenses on the opposite bank.

605
26:15.710 --> 26:19.170
-We will complete the mission. -We will complete the mission.

606
26:24.760 --> 26:25.760
Chiefs,

607
26:26.230 --> 26:28.280
you must be tired after meeting all night.

608
26:28.280 --> 26:28.990
Bocheng.

609
26:29.710 --> 26:31.190
You've been working hard all night too, have you?

610
26:31.190 --> 26:32.560
Has the order to cross the river been issued?

611
26:32.560 --> 26:34.040
It has already been issued.

612
26:34.040 --> 26:35.910
The main forces will split into 3 routes

613
26:35.910 --> 26:37.320
and force a crossing of the Wu River

614
26:37.320 --> 26:39.630
at 3 crossings: Jiangjiehe, Huilongchang,

615
26:39.630 --> 26:40.630
and Chashanguan.

616
26:40.730 --> 26:42.860
Each crossing was to be forced

617
26:42.880 --> 26:44.080
by a single regiment.

618
26:44.150 --> 26:47.390
After a successful crossing, a pontoon bridge will be built on the spot

619
26:47.390 --> 26:49.600
to facilitate the crossing of the main force.

620
26:49.600 --> 26:50.560
Comrade Bocheng,

621
26:50.560 --> 26:52.080
where will the Military Commission Column cross the river?

622
26:52.080 --> 26:54.890
The Military Commission Column plans to cross the river

623
26:54.890 --> 26:56.710
with the 5th Corps from the Jiangjiehe Crossing.

624
26:56.710 --> 26:59.110
The one responsible for opening the crossing channel at this crossing

625
26:59.110 --> 27:01.310
is the 4th Regiment of the 2nd Division.

626
27:02.040 --> 27:04.190
Geng's regiment that seized Jiufeng Mountain?

627
27:04.190 --> 27:04.880
Yes.

628
27:05.280 --> 27:08.110
If we successfully force a crossing of the Wu River this time,

629
27:08.110 --> 27:09.310
they will have made another great contribution.

630
27:09.310 --> 27:09.960
Yes.

631
27:12.040 --> 27:12.840
It's snowing?

632
27:12.990 --> 27:13.630
Chairman,

633
27:13.910 --> 27:15.520
you've been in a meeting all night,

634
27:15.520 --> 27:17.710
and it's been snowing outside all night.

635
27:17.710 --> 27:19.360
Today is January 1st.

636
27:19.630 --> 27:21.040
A timely snow promises a good harvest.

637
27:21.040 --> 27:23.040
Happy New Year, chiefs.

638
27:23.950 --> 27:25.080
I forgot about this.

639
27:25.080 --> 27:33.120
-Happy New Year. -Happy New Year.

640
27:34.790 --> 27:35.510
Comrades,

641
27:35.540 --> 27:37.630
everyone has been in a meeting all night and worked hard.

642
27:37.630 --> 27:38.600
Rest early.

643
27:38.600 --> 27:39.390
Okay.

644
27:46.280 --> 27:47.600
Let's go walk in the snow.

645
27:47.600 --> 27:48.390
Good idea.

646
27:48.570 --> 27:49.290
Let's all

647
27:49.310 --> 27:51.800
go out to walk in the snow and welcome the new year.

648
27:51.800 --> 27:52.600
-Okay. -Okay.

649
27:52.600 --> 27:54.150
Just in time to see the sunrise.

650
27:54.150 --> 27:56.520
It's snowing. Where are we going to see the sunrise?

651
27:56.520 --> 27:58.560
Go to a higher place, up the mountain.

652
27:58.560 --> 27:59.280
Up the mountain.

653
27:59.280 --> 28:02.610
Comrade Zedong, you have to take me with you up the mountain.

654
28:03.360 --> 28:05.490
I won't leave you behind wherever I go.

655
28:05.600 --> 28:06.560
Let's walk the same road through wind and snow.

656
28:06.560 --> 28:07.950
-Let's go. -Go, go, go.

657
28:07.950 --> 28:09.080
Come, be careful.

658
28:09.280 --> 28:09.950
Let's go.

659
28:10.910 --> 28:11.630
Walk in the snow to welcome the new year.

660
28:11.630 --> 28:12.120
Come.

661
28:12.560 --> 28:14.190
A timely snow promises a good harvest.

662
28:14.190 --> 28:15.760
Are we being isolated?

663
28:17.320 --> 28:19.720
We really need to think about it carefully.

664
28:21.600 --> 28:22.600
Comrade Li De,

665
28:22.840 --> 28:23.760
Comrade Bo Gu,

666
28:23.790 --> 28:25.280
let's go walk in the snow together.

667
28:25.280 --> 28:26.630
New year, new beginnings.

668
28:26.630 --> 28:27.950
A timely snow promises a good harvest.

669
28:27.950 --> 28:30.080
A timely snow promises a good harvest.

670
28:30.360 --> 28:33.600
The snow in Moscow is much heavier than here.

671
29:18.520 --> 29:19.780
I really didn't expect

672
29:20.360 --> 29:22.360
that at this time of year in Guizhou,

673
29:22.360 --> 29:24.150
we could still enjoy the snow.

674
29:24.360 --> 29:26.490
A timely snow promises a good harvest.

675
29:26.760 --> 29:28.320
This is a good start.

676
29:28.600 --> 29:31.520
I hope the new year brings a new atmosphere.

677
29:32.120 --> 29:33.190
Comrade Zedong,

678
29:33.800 --> 29:35.260
with such beautiful snow,

679
29:35.280 --> 29:36.760
why don't you, our great poet,

680
29:36.760 --> 29:39.190
improvise a poem about the snow?

681
29:39.190 --> 29:40.150
Yes, yes.

682
29:40.150 --> 29:41.880
Chairman, please compose one.

683
29:42.230 --> 29:44.520
This snow caught us off guard.

684
29:44.910 --> 29:47.150
I'm not Cao Zijian who can compose a poem in 7 steps.

685
29:47.150 --> 29:48.350
How can I just come up with one on the spot?

686
29:48.350 --> 29:49.320
Comrade Zedong.

687
29:49.800 --> 29:51.910
Why are you so modest today?

688
29:52.950 --> 29:54.880
I remember when we were in Tongdao,

689
29:55.720 --> 29:58.340
Comrade Luofu's horse slipped

690
29:58.370 --> 29:59.450
and threw him off.

691
29:59.600 --> 30:01.430
You composed a poem right away.

692
30:01.960 --> 30:02.890
Did that happen?

693
30:02.910 --> 30:03.470
Yes.

694
30:03.600 --> 30:04.710
Why don't I remember?

695
30:04.710 --> 30:06.600
Luofu, do you remember?

696
30:07.390 --> 30:08.390
Don't speak.

697
30:08.470 --> 30:09.150
I don't remember.

698
30:09.150 --> 30:09.910
I remember.

699
30:09.990 --> 30:10.520
Shut up.

700
30:10.670 --> 30:11.080
You...

701
30:11.360 --> 30:14.320
Luofu rode a horse through Hunan.

702
30:14.320 --> 30:14.880
You...

703
30:15.470 --> 30:18.800
He rolled down the mountain with his legs in the air.

704
30:20.120 --> 30:23.280
The man wasn't hurt, and the horse didn't die.

705
30:24.520 --> 30:25.120
Watch out.

706
30:25.150 --> 30:25.800
Be careful.

707
30:25.800 --> 30:26.360
Luofu.

708
30:26.650 --> 30:28.890
May the Bodhisattva keep you safe.

709
30:28.910 --> 30:29.630
Jiaxiang.

710
30:32.600 --> 30:34.430
I beg for mercy. I beg for mercy.

711
30:34.630 --> 30:36.230
Comrade Shaoqi, save me.

712
30:36.230 --> 30:37.670
Which line do you like best, comrades?

713
30:37.670 --> 30:39.760
I like the one about legs in the air best.

714
30:39.760 --> 30:40.710
I like it too.

715
30:40.880 --> 30:41.710
I like it too.

716
30:42.040 --> 30:43.600
Great minds think alike.

717
30:43.670 --> 30:44.230
Yes.

718
30:45.470 --> 30:46.320
I like it too.

719
30:46.600 --> 30:47.860
Commander-in-Chief.

720
30:47.910 --> 30:52.390
Happy New Year! Happy New Year!

721
30:54.560 --> 30:55.520
Comrades.

722
30:55.800 --> 30:56.670
Happy New Year.

723
30:57.760 --> 30:58.840
Happy New Year.

724
30:58.910 --> 30:59.990
Happy New Year.

725
31:00.640 --> 31:01.730
Happy New Year.

726
31:05.120 --> 31:06.400
Happy New Year.

727
31:26.430 --> 31:28.620
[Red Army Martyrs Memorial Tower]

728
32:00.670 --> 32:01.520
Comrades,

729
32:04.830 --> 32:06.140
I'm homesick.

730
32:07.080 --> 32:09.710
I wonder how the comrades left in the Central Soviet Area

731
32:09.710 --> 32:10.750
are doing.

732
32:20.800 --> 32:23.390
I owe you the poem about the snow.

733
32:23.990 --> 32:25.390
Since entering Guizhou,

734
32:25.520 --> 32:26.920
I've gathered a few lines

735
32:27.080 --> 32:29.880
of a poem on mountains in the "Shiliuzi Ling" form.

736
32:30.510 --> 32:32.040
Please give me your advice.

737
32:37.020 --> 32:42.370
Mountains, I whip my fast horse without dismounting.

738
32:42.720 --> 32:47.110
Looking back in surprise, the sky is only 3 feet and 3 inches away.

739
32:48.990 --> 32:53.560
Mountains, like overturning seas and rolling giant waves.

740
32:54.230 --> 32:58.320
Galloping fast, ten thousand horses are still fighting fiercely.

741
32:59.430 --> 33:04.280
Mountains, piercing the blue sky, the blade is not broken.

742
33:05.190 --> 33:10.630
The sky is about to fall, relying on them to support it.

743
33:35.240 --> 33:38.900
[Jiangjiehe Crossing on the Wu River, Weng'an, Guizhou]

744
33:50.700 --> 33:53.480
[Yang Chengwu, Political Commissar of the 4th Regiment, 2nd Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

745
33:53.670 --> 33:56.050
[Geng Biao, Commander of the 4th Regiment, 2nd Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

746
33:58.470 --> 33:59.670
Regiment Commander, Political Commissar.

747
33:59.670 --> 34:01.120
The river-crossing assault team has assembled.

748
34:01.120 --> 34:01.950
Requesting to set off.

749
34:01.950 --> 34:02.320
Good.

750
34:02.390 --> 34:02.880
Move out!

751
34:02.880 --> 34:03.410
Yes, sir.

752
34:47.590 --> 34:48.469
Move out!

753
36:38.690 --> 36:39.550
Quick, grab it.

754
36:50.280 --> 36:51.280
Jump!

755
37:09.680 --> 37:10.680
Behind us.

756
37:38.950 --> 37:39.680
Wang Youcai.

757
37:39.680 --> 37:40.160
Here.

758
37:40.320 --> 37:41.160
Go reinforce them quickly.

759
37:41.160 --> 37:41.690
Yes, sir.

760
37:41.760 --> 37:43.160
Squad 3, follow me.

761
37:52.790 --> 37:53.590
Hold on tight.

762
38:22.340 --> 38:23.500
Hold on!

763
38:23.800 --> 38:24.550
Hold on!

764
38:24.840 --> 38:26.240
Come on, pull them over.

765
38:26.240 --> 38:27.390
Pull them over.

766
38:34.440 --> 38:35.090
Come on.

767
38:42.390 --> 38:43.030
Let's go.

768
38:46.270 --> 38:47.800
Where is Mao Zhenhua's raft?

769
38:47.800 --> 38:49.530
It might have been washed away.

770
38:52.040 --> 38:53.560
Carry them back to warm up.

771
38:54.360 --> 38:55.820
The rest of you, follow me.

772
39:02.590 --> 39:04.110
Reply to Hou Zhidan.

773
39:04.550 --> 39:06.760
Tell him he must hold those crossings.

774
39:06.800 --> 39:07.640
Commander.

775
39:07.760 --> 39:09.430
Deputy Commander Hou asks when the reinforcements will arrive.

776
39:09.430 --> 39:10.310
How should we reply?

777
39:10.310 --> 39:11.160
They will be there soon.

778
39:11.160 --> 39:12.840
They will be there soon!

779
39:13.280 --> 39:13.840
Yes, sir.

780
39:16.360 --> 39:17.800
Can Hou Zhidan hold them?

781
39:18.030 --> 39:21.630
Those 3 regiments have to defend over 50 kilometers of the river.

782
39:21.640 --> 39:22.970
Do you believe they can?

783
39:23.030 --> 39:24.090
I certainly don't.

784
39:24.550 --> 39:25.680
The most urgent task

785
39:25.880 --> 39:28.200
is to ask Xue Yue for help.

786
39:36.390 --> 39:37.520
Where are you going?

787
39:38.360 --> 39:40.160
Hongfu Temple, to burn incense.

788
39:40.200 --> 39:42.070
You've burned so much incense.

789
39:42.530 --> 39:44.260
Did it stop the Communist army?

790
39:44.470 --> 39:47.670
We can only rely on the natural barrier of the Wu River now.

791
39:48.150 --> 39:51.480
Hopefully, it can hold off the Communist army for a few days.

792
39:59.200 --> 40:00.320
Guards!

793
40:00.910 --> 40:01.640
Here.

794
40:02.280 --> 40:04.990
Chairman Wang wants to send a telegram to Commander-in-Chief Xue.

795
40:04.990 --> 40:05.760
Yes, ma'am.

796
40:19.520 --> 40:22.770
[90 kilometers to Guiyang; 1st Red Army Corps]

797
40:24.430 --> 40:27.560
Marching at night makes us vulnerable to sneak attacks.

798
40:27.800 --> 40:28.990
Order all units to close the gaps.

799
40:28.990 --> 40:31.390
-Urgent telegram from Guiyang. -Be alert.

800
40:34.510 --> 40:35.470
Map.

801
40:36.070 --> 40:37.470
Execute it immediately.

802
40:37.910 --> 40:39.040
-Yes, sir -Yes, sir.

803
40:44.250 --> 40:45.980
Commander Xue, what happened?

804
40:47.430 --> 40:49.470
Zhu and Mao's Communist army is forcing a crossing of the Wu River.

805
40:49.470 --> 40:51.330
Wang Jialie is asking us for help.

806
40:51.910 --> 40:55.320
Could Zhu and Mao's Communist army be making a feint?

807
40:55.800 --> 40:57.950
Is their real goal to cross the Wu River to the north?

808
40:57.950 --> 41:00.950
Our deployment to advance on Guiyang will not change.

809
41:01.550 --> 41:04.880
The natural barrier of the Wu River is not that easy to cross.

810
41:05.950 --> 41:07.470
Send a telegram to Zhou Hunyuan.

811
41:07.470 --> 41:09.760
Tell him to dispatch the 5th Division, 13th Division,

812
41:09.760 --> 41:11.960
and 96th Division to split into 3 routes

813
41:11.990 --> 41:13.840
and scout and suppress Wengan,

814
41:13.840 --> 41:16.240
Yuqing, and Houchang towards the Wu River.

815
41:16.490 --> 41:17.020
Yes, sir.

816
41:20.030 --> 41:21.320
Take a picture of this.

817
41:23.020 --> 41:23.750
Yes, sir.

818
41:26.280 --> 41:28.740
Regiment Commander, Political Commissar.

819
41:29.110 --> 41:30.590
Regiment Commander, Political Commissar.

820
41:30.590 --> 41:32.150
We searched another few kilometers of the river downstream.

821
41:32.150 --> 41:33.150
We found nothing.

822
41:38.840 --> 41:41.070
Could Mao Zhenhua and the others have already crossed?

823
41:41.070 --> 41:43.280
There's no signal from the opposite bank.

824
41:43.280 --> 41:45.240
Regiment Commander, I'll take another company and force a crossing.

825
41:45.240 --> 41:47.090
No, the wind is too strong now.

826
41:47.110 --> 41:49.160
So Mao Zhenhua is just gone like this?

827
41:49.160 --> 41:49.880
I can't accept it.

828
41:49.880 --> 41:51.680
You have to accept it even if you can't.

829
41:51.680 --> 41:52.760
Everyone stand by.

830
41:53.110 --> 41:54.500
Without orders from the regiment headquarters,

831
41:54.500 --> 41:55.900
no one is allowed to move.

832
41:58.510 --> 42:00.440
Regiment Commander, Regiment...

833
42:04.680 --> 42:07.200
I've talked to Liu Bocheng and Nie Rongzhen,

834
42:07.320 --> 42:09.360
called the 3rd Corps,

835
42:09.510 --> 42:11.680
and exchanged views with Comrade Peng Dehuai.

836
42:11.680 --> 42:14.800
Everyone agrees to change the military commander.

837
42:15.070 --> 42:17.230
They fully support Comrade Zedong

838
42:17.370 --> 42:19.100
taking command of the Red Army.

839
42:19.430 --> 42:21.490
Good. The troops have no objections.

840
42:21.640 --> 42:22.680
As for the Central Committee,

841
42:22.680 --> 42:24.280
judging from last night's Politburo meeting,

842
42:24.280 --> 42:25.080
we can see that

843
42:25.200 --> 42:26.840
there shouldn't be a big problem either.

844
42:26.840 --> 42:27.630
Right now,

845
42:27.680 --> 42:30.550
I'm just worried they won't hand over power easily.

846
42:30.760 --> 42:33.320
We support Comrade Zedong commanding the Red Army

847
42:33.320 --> 42:34.590
not for personal gain,

848
42:34.680 --> 42:35.950
so there's nothing to worry about.

849
42:35.950 --> 42:36.560
Exactly.

850
42:37.240 --> 42:38.640
Once the troops cross the Wu River

851
42:38.640 --> 42:39.990
and reach the Zunyi area,

852
42:39.990 --> 42:41.910
I will use my status as a Politburo Standing Committee member

853
42:41.910 --> 42:43.990
to propose to Comrades Bo Gu, Enlai, and others

854
42:43.990 --> 42:44.720
to hold a meeting.

855
42:44.720 --> 42:45.240
Right.

856
42:47.400 --> 42:48.800
Where is Comrade Zedong?

857
42:49.130 --> 42:52.060
He heard there were difficulties crossing the river

858
42:52.200 --> 42:53.110
and went to the riverbank.

859
42:53.110 --> 42:54.200
I heard that too.

860
42:55.360 --> 42:57.510
The 1st and 4th Regiments

861
42:58.070 --> 43:00.680
failed in their operations at both crossings.
